; ============================================================
; accounts.bean — Chart of accounts
;
; This file defines the chart of accounts for the ledger. It is
; included in main.bean and should not be included directly in
; any other file. To close an account, add a new line with the
; date and the "close" directive.
;
; All naming, metadata, ordering, and formatting rules for this
; file live in rules.md, sections 2 and 4. Keep this file free of
; rule text so a change only ever needs to happen in one place.
; ============================================================

; ============================================================
; ASSETS — Things I own
; ============================================================

; --- Cash ---
2001-03-20 open Assets:Cash:Wallet

; --- Bank accounts ---
; To receive salary and save money
2001-03-20 open Assets:Bank:Bancolombia
; To cover daily expenses
2001-03-20 open Assets:Bank:Nequi
; To invest and shop online
2026-06-26 open Assets:Bank:Nu

